1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,250
A model more than 100 times smaller won.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:11,025
GPT-3 has 175 billion parameters,
trained only to predict web text.

3
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:14,200
Bigger is always better, right?

4
00:00:14,817 --> 00:00:20,708
In the InstructGPT paper, people preferred
answers from a 1.3 billion parameter

5
00:00:20,708 --> 00:00:23,467
model trained to follow instructions.

6
00:00:24,483 --> 00:00:26,883
Training matters as much as size.

7
00:00:27,183 --> 00:00:30,833
That's how a model more than 100
times smaller won.
